# Coverage config for CI — excludes modules that require scoring/whisper extras.
#
# Why scorers are excluded:
# All seven scorers technically run on CPU (faster-whisper makes text_accuracy
# viable, just slower), so the *code* could be tested in CI. The blocker is the
# CI image — it doesn't ship the heavy scoring deps (faster-whisper, audiobox-
# aesthetics, librosa model weights), and adding them blows up image size and
# runtime for marginal benefit on a single-developer project.
#
# Full coverage (including scorers) is measured locally with all extras
# installed. Revisit this when the project moves to multi-user deployment, gets
# a beefier CI runner, or a scorer regression actually slips through.
#
[run]
omit =
    src/songmaker_cli/scoring/audiobox_aesthetics.py
    src/songmaker_cli/scoring/bpm_accuracy.py
    src/songmaker_cli/scoring/emotional_dynamics.py
    src/songmaker_cli/scoring/lyrical_coherence.py
    src/songmaker_cli/scoring/silence_detection.py
    src/songmaker_cli/scoring/spectral_quality.py
    src/songmaker_cli/scoring/text_accuracy.py
    src/songmaker_cli/main.py
    src/songmaker_cli/mcp_server/__main__.py
